{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/14","id":4901019799,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVMrF8s8AAAABJB-glw","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/14","diff_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/14.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/14.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/issues/14","number":14,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Reject malformed sitemap references and preserve valid one-pass decoding","user":{"login":"tsm0420","id":62269874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjY5ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62269874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThe installed XML validator/decoder could mark undeclared entities, prohibited numeric references and invalid literal characters as passing sitemap evidence. Validate original XML 1.0 character/reference tokens with tag/attribute context before counting URLs; malformed input now yields sitemap fail, duplicates unknown/null and exit 1. Valid long numeric spellings compact before the inherited decoder's 32-character scan, preserving one-pass identity and literal CDATA/escaped text.\n\n```text\noriginal XML -> structure + character/reference checks -> one decode -> URL evidence\n       invalid -> sitemap fail / duplicate unknown / null summary\n```\n\nExisting DTD exclusion, structural parser and expansion-limit settings remain. This is bounded checking, not full XML/schema/namespace/encoding certification. Relates to #10, TICKET-012 only. **Depends on unmerged #13**, transitively #12/#11/#9; targets #13's branch.\n\n## Evidence\n\nReal CLI red/green evidence covers malformed names/numerics/attributes/characters, legal boundaries, literal sections, escaped output and long spellings. Initial Spec review found a quoted-marker bypass; three false-success regressions were added and fixed, and both axes independently reviewed the revision. Final Standards and Spec report no outstanding findings; each ran all 38 XML tests, and Spec repeated the three original bypass probes successfully. Full suite: 108 pass, zero skips; typecheck/build pass.\n\nReviewed source `54c8e908be7a9a0f86e0853f9f17e42888f692c1` passed clean-source checks and 21 expected extracted-package outcomes. Package SHA-256 `b0dac211c1c8abbcd628e4daf7f024d7de6cbe853f863e71a502ef7e5445f807`. Frozen YinThread inputs, 16/1/2 summary, 146/145/1 counts and positions 8,12 remain unchanged. Original research/red/green/runtime/inventory receipts: `docs/verification/TICKET-012/`; separate initial/final reviews: `docs/reviews/TICKET-012/`.\n\nHead `1e3fe4377f7a6d5b62be1ffe87a8a21b57292c79` adds verification documents only after reviewed source. Exact-head CI succeeded for `1e3fe4377f7a6d5b62be1ffe87a8a21b57292c79`: [verify job](https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/actions/runs/39042126571/job/117423562041), observed through Code Review. All executable/CI inputs and packaged file hashes match the reviewed candidate.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\nDoor: two-way. Blast radius: local sitemap validity and decoded duplicate evidence. Previously tolerated malformed XML now fails visibly. No new dependency, validator migration, live crawl, merge, tag or release.","created_at":"2026-10-17T14:45:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:46:53Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"40ad0e8fb9f6a351a72a2de00d9d4784ea640516","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/14/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/14/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/issues/14/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/statuses/1e3fe4377f7a6d5b62be1ffe87a8a21b57292c79","head":{"label":"tsm0420:codex/sitemap-xml-references","ref":"codex/sitemap-xml-references","sha":"1e3fe4377f7a6d5b62be1ffe87a8a21b57292c79","user":{"login":"tsm0420","id":62269874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjY5ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62269874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1422575090,"node_id":"R_kgDOVMrF8g","name":"geo-growth-engine","full_name":"tsm0420/geo-growth-engine","priv